; Placeholder MP4 file — BoxOS 1.0 doesn't have an MP4 decoder.
; Video decode is unlikely to ever land in BoxOS proper: H.264 alone
; is tens of thousands of lines, and the MP4 container parsing
; (atoms, sample tables, time-to-sample maps, codec init) is several
; thousand more. The OS will keep the .MP4 type label so you can
; *see* video files in your Documents, but playback isn't on the
; roadmap.
